<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>M/s C.P. & Associates Pvt. Ltd. v. Delhi Metro Rail Corporation Ltd., FAO(OS) (COMM) 186/2023</td></tr>
